  "notes": "Bedford County Republicans elect committee persons in presidential-year primaries: the official 2024 primary report lists one Republican Committee Person contest per precinct (40, Vote For 2, not gender-designated), while the 2026 primary carried only Democratic county committee contests (from the posted unofficial 2026 summary; no official 2026 file is linked). A named ballot candidate who received votes is filled. Seats left only to write-ins are unknown, including where the report lists named write-in recipients, because it does not show whether a write-in qualified or accepted. Seats with no candidate and zero votes are empty. Appointments since 2024 are not captured. Holder names come from the official results export: on each seat already counted as filled, the winning ballot candidate as printed (named write-ins are never used)."
